{{JPExclusive}}
'''Yakisoba Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] who was introduced in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] and can be unlocked as a daily reward stamp during the [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 541
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Yakisoba Cat
|name2 = Splendid!Thick!Big!Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Splendid!Thick!Big!Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
It is similar to [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], but worse in every way except for having Jamiera Cat's knockback. You can use him as a Jamiera Cat alternative in {{4c}} stages if you don't have [[Li'l Titan Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Jamiera Cat]], but the usage of a tanker with such low stats in {{4c}} isn't recommended anyways.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Tanker}}

